WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,460 --> 00:00:06,260
Why is it so warm here

2
00:00:06,260 --> 00:00:08,860
Is it because of the small blue light square on the table?

3
00:00:08,860 --> 00:00:10,660
Why is there hot water here?

4
00:00:10,660 --> 00:00:12,660
There are only about eighty bottles in this house.

5
00:00:12,660 --> 00:00:15,500
Tell me where to put the food?

6
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:17,100
Where does your ability come from?

7
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:18,720
what does it mean

8
00:00:18,720 --> 00:00:19,920
Don’t you already have it?

9
00:00:19,920 --> 00:00:20,920
And asked me how I got here

10
00:00:20,920 --> 00:00:22,520
Don't give me any excuses

11
00:00:22,520 --> 00:00:23,920
Speak well

12
00:00:23,920 --> 00:00:26,520
Maybe I can help you with your fracture

13
00:00:26,520 --> 00:00:29,210
Wasn't it you who broke this girl's arm?

14
00:00:30,570 --> 00:00:31,970
I was there that night when it snowed

15
00:00:31,970 --> 00:00:33,770
I accidentally touched the snow

16
00:00:34,450 --> 00:00:36,650
But it doesn’t have a long farm package like others

17
00:00:36,650 --> 00:00:38,650
Instead, he developed a high fever

18
00:00:38,650 --> 00:00:40,250
I burned it at home for three days

19
00:00:40,250 --> 00:00:42,050
After the fever subsides

20
00:00:42,050 --> 00:00:44,050
I found that my body became stronger

21
00:00:44,690 --> 00:00:46,550
This is unexpected

22
00:00:46,550 --> 00:00:48,150
It seems that there is a very low probability of this heavy snowfall

23
00:00:48,150 --> 00:00:49,820
Can make people evolve

24
00:00:49,820 --> 00:00:51,020
I'm afraid that after I go out

25
00:00:51,020 --> 00:00:53,400
You may encounter more people with super powers

26
00:00:53,400 --> 00:00:55,000
In addition to getting stronger physically

27
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:56,200
Are there any other changes?

28
00:00:56,200 --> 00:00:57,400
I'm not afraid of the cold anymore

29
00:00:57,400 --> 00:00:58,400
There's more

30
00:00:58,400 --> 00:01:00,000
Then are you afraid of poisonous blood?

31
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:01,400
Then I don't dare to try

32
00:01:01,400 --> 00:01:02,800
I'm afraid to give it a try.
